  <Fragment slot="lessons">
<li>Explore public leases with actual terms, payments and selection rules. A lease changes the land arrangement; it does not erase costs.</li>
<li>Design shared rooms around residents’ routines, then budget their cleaning, utilities and replacement.</li>
<li>Translate tenure with a local housing lawyer. A California co-op or land trust is not a legal copy of cession of use.</li>
</Fragment>

